Description: Shared copied-present check for EGL X11 and the Vulkan stereo layer
 GLX, EGL and the packed Vulkan layer use one transition rule and one
 problems-engine transport; EGL DRI3 retains packed buffer width and the
 software path preserves its first left view and excludes row padding.
Author: Daniel Campos Ramos
Forwarded: no
Last-Update: 2026-11-14

